{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-template-excerpt-js","path":"/excerpts/freya_invocation/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"url":"https://poetry.me.uk"}},"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>With this here temple, be brought forth,<br>\nThis beauty that's forged is all yours,<br>\nThe space is cleansed and candles lit,<br>\nAll's made ready for us to meet,</p>\n<p>As wished, now made true,<br>\nAll of this, done for you,</p>\n<p>Draped in moonlight come to my side,<br>\nAll for you I perform these rites,<br>\nA marriage to grow from planted seeds,<br>\nWorthy made for you here to be,</p>\n<p>Now raised, here your shrine,<br>\nThis is all, done for you,</p>\n<p>From fresh flower scents more grows,<br>\nAll so better you I can know,<br>\nCome forth to this place of care formed,<br>\nIn service this ritual crafts bonds,</p>\n<p>All of this, done for you,<br>\nOffered up, just for you,</p>\n<p>Come forth beauty into being,<br>\nGoddess whom I do believe in,<br>\nMade ready is my heart within,<br>\nFor you to come forth when willing.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/29007/freya_invocation.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 100%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Freya Invocation\"\n        title=\"Freya Invocation\"\n        src=\"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/5a190/freya_invocation.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/772e8/freya_invocation.png 200w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/e17e5/freya_invocation.png 400w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/5a190/freya_invocation.png 800w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/c1b63/freya_invocation.png 1200w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/29007/freya_invocation.png 1600w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>","excerpt":"With this here temple, be brought forth, This beauty that's forged is all yours, The space is cleansed and candles lit, All's made ready for us to meet, As wished, now made true, All of this, done for you, Draped in moonlight come to my side, All for…","rawMarkdownBody":"\nWith this here temple, be brought forth,  \nThis beauty that's forged is all yours,  \nThe space is cleansed and candles lit,  \nAll's made ready for us to meet,  \n\nAs wished, now made true,  \nAll of this, done for you,  \n\nDraped in moonlight come to my side,  \nAll for you I perform these rites,  \nA marriage to grow from planted seeds,  \nWorthy made for you here to be,  \n\nNow raised, here your shrine,  \nThis is all, done for you,  \n\nFrom fresh flower scents more grows,  \nAll so better you I can know,  \nCome forth to this place of care formed,  \nIn service this ritual crafts bonds,  \n\nAll of this, done for you,  \nOffered up, just for you,  \n\nCome forth beauty into being,  \nGoddess whom I do believe in,  \nMade ready is my heart within,  \nFor you to come forth when willing.  \n\n![Freya Invocation](./freya_invocation.png)\n\n","fields":{"slug":"/excerpts/freya_invocation/"},"frontmatter":{"date":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z","displayDate":"October 31, 2026","title":"Freya Invocation","tags":"pagan love spell","book":null,"video":null,"icon":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#c8b8a8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/e8b76/freya_invocation.png","srcSet":"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/30cdc/freya_invocation.png 300w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/c7240/freya_invocation.png 600w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/e8b76/freya_invocation.png 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/078c3/freya_invocation.webp 300w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/6d09e/freya_invocation.webp 600w,\n/static/20f83f75e8d3a3c6364e2cb45d125dda/83805/freya_invocation.webp 1200w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"}]},"width":1200,"height":1200}}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/excerpts/freya_invocation/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1086662010","3649515864"]}